---
name: GCP VM Orion Backend
description: GCP e2-standard-4 VM running FastAPI with proxy/cache, TTS, STT, vision for Orion
type: reference
---
- Instance: orion-backend
- Zone: us-central1-f
- Machine: e2-standard-4 (4 vCPUs, 16GB RAM, x86_64, CPU only)
- OS: Debian 12 Bookworm x86_64
- Service Account: 550674472945-compute@developer.gserviceaccount.com
- External IP: 136.114.97.124 (STATIC — orion-static-ip)
- Internal IP: 10.128.0.3
- Port: 8080
- Server: FastAPI — PATH: ~/orion-vm-bundle/server.py
- Edge function proxy: supabase/functions/orion-vm-proxy/index.ts
- Secret: ORION_VM_URL = http://136.114.97.124:8080
- Endpoints: /health, /tts, /stt, /vision/detect, /vision/classify, /ocr, /embeddings, /proxy/gemini, /cache/stats
- Models: whisper-tiny (int8), DETR-resnet-50, EasyOCR, all-MiniLM-L6-v2, Piper pt_BR
- Priority: VM (primary) → HF Space (fallback) — managed in orion-hub-client.ts
- Memory limit: systemd MemoryMax=3G
- Scopes: cloud-platform ✅
- Tags: http-server ✅
- Firewall: allow-orion-8080 (tcp:8080, source 0.0.0.0/0, target http-server)
- SSH: gcloud compute ssh orion-backend --zone=us-central1-f --tunnel-through-iap
- Gemini: GEMINI_API_KEY configured in systemd override, use gemini-2.5-flash-lite
- IP is now STATIC (orion-static-ip) — no need to update secret after stop/start
